                  "content": "Engagement is too hard to count",
                  "correct": false,
                  "id": "fct-module-13-helping-thrive-q1-c0"
                },
                {
                  "content": "Addictive experiences mimic thriving — stimulation impersonating meaning — while undermining the real thing",
